   "relation": "host-of"
  },
  {
   "id": "json",
   "relation": "family"
  }
 ],
 "level_notes": {
  "1": "Normative docs are the markdown specs in the hashicorp/hcl repo: spec.md (syntax-agnostic information model), hclsyntax/spec.md (native syntax) and json/spec.md (JSON syntax).",
  "0": "The Go module github.com/hashicorp/hcl/v2 is the reference implementation; the cty type system lives in zclconf/go-cty.",
  "2": "Little standalone tutorial literature; most learning material is Terraform's."
 },
